Makes sim.rs `discarded_since` take every record a node wrote at a path
before its revert as discarded, the record the revert put back and those
below it included, as before 878e417. The fix sets aside only the node's
versions above the restored record, which are the pending ones; the restored
record was announced and stands (DESIGN.md §8.3, §14.1 I3).

test: delocal-sim regressions::a_revert_discards_only_the_versions_above_the_restored_record
test: delocal-sim sim::tests::a_revert_sets_aside_only_the_versions_above_the_record_it_restored

diff --git a/crates/sim/src/sim.rs b/crates/sim/src/sim.rs
